{title: Seene Me Jalan}
{artist: Suresh Wadkar}
{key: F#}

{c: Verse 1}
[F#]seene mein jalan [E]aankhon mein tufaan [F#]saa kyon hai
[F#]is shahar mein [E]har shaks pareshaan [F#]saa kyon hai
[F#]dil hai [B]to dhadkaane [E]ka bahaanaa [F#]koee dhoondhe
[F#]patthar kee [E]tarah behees-o-bejaan [F#]saa kyon hai
[F#]tanhaee [B]kee ye [E]kaunsee manzil [F#]hai rafeekon
[F#]taa-hadde-nazar ek [E]bayaabaan saa [F#]kyun hai
[F#]kyaa koee [B]nayee baat [E]nazar aatee [F#]hai hum me
[F#]aaeena humein [E]dekh ke hairaan [F#]saa kyun hai
